{"type":"text","timestamp":1787994670576,"sessionID":"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185","part":{"id":"prt_04cc98341001BsMnOjQ1Odimy7","messageID":"msg_04cc97a9b001lNo7TdJLZQeRBP","sessionID":"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185","type":"text","text":"I've read the brief. The task: add settings API routes to `mg serve` — set the default profile (global), and the base branch + prefix per project. Interesting: `docs/AGENTS.md` already documents these endpoints. Let me check whether they're actually implemented.\n\n","time":{"start":1787994669889,"end":1787994670574}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787994671185,"sessionID":"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"glob","callID":"call_31ad0a43d74345a4b4cdbf0f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"src/internal/serve/**"},"output":"/workspace/src/internal/serve/settings_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/settings.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/testutil_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/stream_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/stream.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/server.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/security_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/registry_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/registry.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/mutate_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/mutate.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/locks_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/locks.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/credentials_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/concurrency_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/auth_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/auth.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/audit_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/audit.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/api_test.go\n/workspace/src/internal/serve/api.go","metadata":{"count":21,"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1787994670516,"end":1787994671182}},"id":"prt_04cc985530017rvH2ebqXXcfzC","sessionID":"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185","messageID":"msg_04cc97a9b001lNo7TdJLZQeRBP"}}
