es_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc133560013wrz4Ag98mxIqm\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc112900017pGzNEPMlxcSTI\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now update the docs. Let me find the exact sections in `docs/AGENTS.md` (the canonical source — never the read-only overlay):\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994175466,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc1f5ba001AY7FLCywCcN96l\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc1db74001MeKWt6BTZcs4jZ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now build, vet, and run the test suite:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994206224,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc26e02001m1WZ2H2VjZQAFW\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc264ad001kiTE76HCdP2FQe\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All new tests pass. Now the full suite:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994217898,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc299a00016ju0aAITOXlTHr\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc27e91001i2pLNGLLXBFmaP\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The `internal/ui` failures are the session's git shim refusing `git init` — an artifact of running tests inside the agent container, unrelated to my change. Let me confirm scope:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994230633,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc2c75a001WkmN2gn3WvQ1Dg\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc2b2fb0012GUrV143XlPa8U\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"`internal/serve`, `internal/config`, `internal/project` all pass. The failing packages need `git init` (blocked by the session git shim). Let me verify these failures are pre-existing by testing against the pre-change tree:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994239074,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc2e9e8001OTlk1b6Gp4dV42\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc2dc0b001C3D7XKnGcG8Rli\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Stash is refused by the session shim (expected — my changes are intact). Let me verify the failures are the shim, not my code, by inspecting one directly:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994248008,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc30df0001BSdYcS9zUa1ujg\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc2f184001dEb3GC89iw9d2v\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Confirmed environmental — the shim blocks `git init`/`git worktree`, and my change touches none of those packages. Run the serve package with `-race` to validate the new lock-taking handler:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994269623,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc364b4001V0LPyAG0rH9e7t\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc339cc001ubLiYTGQVRmTXg\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Race detector needs gcc (absent in the container) — the plain run stands as verification. Let me do a final review of the implementation file, then write implementation.md and commit:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994281989,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc39049001GCAMQ4jSqxdrR7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc367e0001vYZAhRkc4du21v\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3458985ffeeMJ5OFBVh1MOcx\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Two typos to fix — `refRefComponentMaxLen` and a stale function name in a doc comment:\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994670576,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc98341001BsMnOjQ1Odimy7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc97a9b001lNo7TdJLZQeRBP\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I've read the brief. The task: add settings API routes to `mg serve` — set the default profile (global), and the base branch + prefix per project. Interesting: `docs/AGENTS.md` already documents these endpoints. Let me check whether they're actually implemented.\\n\\n\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994672432,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc98bbf001x4OBcr0RCit2kM\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc98870001QNYwqQTR13svDH\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"There's already a `settings.go` and `settings_test.go`. Let me examine what exists versus what the brief wants.\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994675552,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc9960c0013Ey31DLFG9jejY\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc98d44001cGOqep95O6Thpj\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The implementation files already exist. Let me check whether they're on this branch or already merged into main, and whether the routes are wired up.\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994678102,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc9a0df001oB9JrIYCMyKFwW\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc99973001p3Vk5x6tcEXiHs\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This job's implementation already exists on the branch. Let me check the job's other files to understand its stage.\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994684927,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc9b8c7001Cr4NOIV6C9MUcj\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04cc9a36b001lQoF8wlxuPyQWd\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The implementation files exist but `implementation.md`/`verdict.md` are still templates. Let me investigate the branch history to understand what's been done and what remains.\"\n\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787994690189,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb3368eedffetvzxol071th185\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04cc9c96800126phr4